{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"extern","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOption","preciseIdentifier":"c:MLNShapeSource.h@T@MLNShapeSourceOption","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOption"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterProperties","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The first object determines how the attribute values are accumulated from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cluster points. It is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExpression"},{"text":" with an expression function that accepts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"two or more arguments, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sum"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"max"},{"text":". The arguments should be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"featureAccumulated"},{"text":" and the previously defined feature attribute key. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resulting value is assigned to the specified attribute key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The second "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExpression"},{"type":"text","text":" in the array determines which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute values are accessed from individual features within a cluster."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let firstExpression = NSExpression(format: \"sum:({$featureAccumulated, sumValue})\")","let secondExpression = NSExpression(forKeyPath: \"magnitude\")","let c